"""
A launch from rest: 600 N m drives a J = 1 kg m² wheel inertia, whose default `Slip` tire
(r = 0.31 m, F_z = 6864.655 N) pushes a 1400 kg mass. The road multiplier is set per case, and
`lifted` also sets the tire's load.

`wheelspin`, mu_scale = 0.2: the tire can pass at most r mu_A mu_scale F_z = 0.31 · 0.2 ·
6864.655 = 425.6 N m, less than the 600 N m applied, so the wheel spins up past sSlide and the
tire slides at F_x = 0.2 · 0.7 · 6864.655 = 961.0517 N. The mass then accelerates at
961.0517/1400 = 0.686466 m/s² and the wheel at (600 - 0.31 · 961.0517)/1 = 302.07397 rad/s².

`grip`, mu_scale = 1: the tire can pass 2128 N m, so it grips at a steady slip kappa. Steady slip
means r dw/dt = (1 + kappa) dv/dt; with m dv/dt = F_x and J dw/dt = tau - r F_x this gives

    F_x = (tau r/J) / (r²/J + (1 + kappa)/m)

and F_x = mu(kappa) F_z on the rising cubic, mu(kappa) = mu_A c(kappa/sAdhesion). Iterating the
two from kappa = 0 settles at kappa = 0.0075525, F_x = 1921.097 N (mu = 0.279853), so the mass
accelerates at 1921.097/1400 = 1.372212 m/s². The slip relaxes to that point at a rate of
(r²/J + 1/m) F_z mu'(kappa)/max(v, v_eps) = 0.096814 · 6864.655 · 36.16/max(v, 0.5) =
24000/max(v, 0.5) 1/s, at least 17000 1/s while v stays below 1.4 m/s, so by 1 s it is there.

`lifted`, F_z = -3448.8795 N on a dry road, the load the `LoadedSlip` rig's axle would carry under
20 kN of lift without its floor: the tire is off the road and passes no force, so the mass stays at
rest and the whole 600 N m spins up the wheel at 600/1 = 600 rad/s². A tire that passed mu F_n
with the negative load would instead slide at mu_S and pull the mass backward at
0.7 · 3448.8795/1400 = 1.724440 m/s².
"""
test component Slip
  drive = RotationalComponents.Sources.ConstantTorque(tau_constant = 600.0) {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 1050, "x2": 950, "y1": 200, "y2": 300}}}
  }
  housing = RotationalComponents.Components.Fixed() {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 950, "x2": 1050, "y1": 450, "y2": 550}}}
  }
  inertia = RotationalComponents.Components.Inertia(J = 1.0, phi = initial 0.0, w = initial 0.0) {
    "Dyad": {
      "placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 700, "x2": 800, "y1": 200, "y2": 300, "rot": 180}}
    }
  }
  wheel = VehicleComponents.Chassis.Wheel.Slip() {
    "Dyad": {
      "placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 450, "x2": 550, "y1": 300, "y2": 400, "rot": 90}}
    }
  }
  body = TranslationalComponents.Components.Mass(m = 1400.0, s = initial 0.0, v = initial 0.0) {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 700, "x2": 800, "y1": 450, "y2": 550}}}
  }
  "Road-friction multiplier, overridden per case"
  road = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 1.0) {
    "Dyad": {"placement": {"diagram": {"x1": 200, "x2": 300, "y1": 300, "y2": 400}}}
  }
relations
  connect(drive.spline, inertia.spline_a) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(drive.support, housing.spline) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(inertia.spline_b, wheel.spline) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 500, "y": 250}], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(wheel.flange, body.flange_a) {"Dyad": {"edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 500, "y": 500}], "E": 2}], "path": {}}}
  connect(road.y, wheel.mu_scale) {
    "Dyad": {
      "edges": [{"S": 1, "M": [{"x": 400, "y": 350}, {"x": 400, "y": 325}], "E": 2}],
      "path": {}
    }
  }
metadata {
  "Dyad": {
    "tests": {
      "wheelspin": {
        "stop": 2,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"road.k": 0.2},
        "atol": {"wheel.F_x": 0.001, "body.a": 1e-6, "inertia.a": 0.0001},
        "expect": {
          "initial": {"wheel.kappa": 0.0},
          "final": {"wheel.F_x": 961.0517, "body.a": 0.686466, "inertia.a": 302.07397}
        }
      },
      "grip": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "atol": {"wheel.kappa": 1e-6, "body.a": 1e-5},
        "expect": {
          "initial": {"wheel.kappa": 0.0},
          "final": {"wheel.kappa": 0.0075525, "body.a": 1.372212}
        }
      },
      "lifted": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"wheel.F_z": -3448.8795},
        "atol": {"wheel.F_x": 1e-6, "body.a": 1e-6, "inertia.a": 0.0001},
        "expect": {"final": {"wheel.F_x": 0.0, "body.a": 0.0, "inertia.a": 600.0}}
      }
    }
  }
}
end
